POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"nobody@example.com","password":"password123"}

### 33. Auth: POST /api/login — Valid credentials (expect 200 + Bearer token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"admin@istanbul.edu.tr","password":"AdminMis2026!"}

