Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"short@example.com","password":"12","first_name":"Short","last_name":"Pass"}

### 37. Auth: POST /api/register — Successful registration (expect 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "new.graduate@alumni.iu.edu.tr",
    "password": "Secure2026!",
    "first_name": "Yeni",
    "last_name": "Mezun",
    "role": "alumni"
}

### 38. Auth: POST /api/register — Duplicate email (expect 422)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/register
Content-Type: application/json

