    "email": "admin@istanbul.edu.tr",
    "password": "AdminMis2026!",
    "first_name": "Admin",
    "last_name": "Duplicate"
}

### 39. Protected: GET /api/profile — No token (expect 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile
Accept: application/json

### 40. Protected: GET /api/profile — Invalid token (expect 401)
